# Swanirbhar AI Workbench 🚀

**Your intelligent workspace for AI‑powered productivity.**

A sleek desktop application built with PySide6 (Qt) by Team TechTitans.  
It provides a unified interface for AI model management, project tracking, document handling, and real‑time system monitoring.

---

## ✨ Features
- 📊 **Dashboard** – Chat with an AI assistant (demo mode), manage documents and output files.
- 📁 **Projects** – View and manage your AI projects in a beautiful grid.
- 📈 **Reports** – Generate and track reports with progress animation.
- ⚙️ **Settings** – Customize themes, AI models, storage paths, and privacy preferences.
- 📊 **Monitoring** – Real‑time CPU, Memory, GPU, Disk, and Wi‑Fi stats with animated bars.
- 🕒 **History** – Complete activity log with timestamps and persistent JSON storage.
- 📋 **Logs** – Live system logs with color‑coded levels and file persistence.
- ❓ **Help** – Built‑in documentation and support contact.

---

## 🖥️ Download & Install
- **Windows**: Download the `.exe` from our [official download page](https://your-link-here.com).
- **Linux**: For Linux users, an `.AppImage` is also available on the same page.

Simply download and run – no Python or additional dependencies required.

